# graphify-only rules for the reference corpus.
# The repo .gitignore hides *.pdf and *.txt from git (licensing); for the
# knowledge graph we DO want the text sidecars indexed. Last match wins.
!*.txt
# Keep the PDFs out of the graph anyway: each paper is indexed once via its
# .txt sidecar; extracting the PDF too would duplicate every node.
*.pdf
# The Ostrom book (REF-14b) is held for background reading only; it is
# DROPPED from the citation register, so keep it out of the graph.
REF-14b_*
